1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,994
A one percent fee sounds like nothing.
It's a slow-ass robbery, and it's
legal.

2
00:00:04,844 --> 00:00:10,175
Five hundred a month for forty years
at seven percent. The one percent fee
eats three hundred sixteen grand.

3
00:00:10,425 --> 00:00:13,226
That's more than you ever put in.

4
00:00:14,126 --> 00:00:16,596
Send this to the friend who's never
checked their fees.
